@startuml
title DEV programs artwork lookup and generation
actor Learner
participant "Web /courses" as Web
participant "GotIt Backend" as API
database "Existing raster cache" as Cache
participant "OpenAI Images" as AI
Learner -> Web: View or activate program
Web -> API: Authenticated artwork lookup (kind + ID/language)
API -> API: Entitlement, owner, bounded subject, fingerprint
API -> Cache: Read hashed scoped key
alt cache hit
  Cache --> API: WebP
  API --> Web: image + fingerprint
else cache miss
  API --> Web: image null
  Web -> API: Generate (serialized paid miss)
  API -> API: Quota + coalesce + concurrency bound
  API -> AI: Bounded course subject OR canonical Mohi + language
  AI --> API: Raster
  API -> API: Validate/resize; recheck owner/current content
  API -> Cache: Persist isolated policy namespace
  API --> Web: WebP + fingerprint
else unavailable
  API --> Web: Explicit error
  Web --> Learner: Localized retry; program controls remain usable
end
note over Web,Cache: No lesson, evidence, mastery, XP or wallet writes
@enduml
